("Exam date","Date de l'examen","Itariki y'ikizamini","Tarehe ya mtihani"),("Fee paid to","Frais payés à","Amafaranga yishyuwe","Ada imelipwa kwa"),("Result","Résultat","Ibyavuye mu kizamini","Matokeo"),("Certificate issued by","Certificat délivré par","Icyemezo cyatanzwe na","Cheti kimetolewa na"),("Register for an exam","S'inscrire à un examen","Iyandikishe ku kizamini","Jisajili kwa mtihani"),("Examining body","Organisme d'examen","Urwego rutanga ikizamini","Bodi ya mtihani"),("Exam name","Nom de l'examen","Izina ry'ikizamini","Jina la mtihani"),
("Exam fees are paid to IATA or ICAO through the School. The certificate is issued by IATA or ICAO.","Les frais d'examen sont payés à l'IATA ou à l'OACI via l'école. Le certificat est délivré par l'IATA ou l'OACI.","Amafaranga y'ikizamini yishyurwa IATA cyangwa ICAO binyuze ku ishuri. Icyemezo gitangwa na IATA cyangwa ICAO.","Ada za mtihani hulipwa kwa IATA au ICAO kupitia shule. Cheti hutolewa na IATA au ICAO."),("Request sent. The School will register you and confirm the date.","Demande envoyée. L'école vous inscrira et confirmera la date.","Icyifuzo cyoherejwe. Ishuri rizakwandika rikwemeze itariki.","Ombi limetumwa. Shule itakusajili na kuthibitisha tarehe."),
