("These certificates are issued by IATA or ICAO, not by the School. They are recorded here when the School receives them.","Ces certificats sont délivrés par l'IATA ou l'OACI, non par l'école. Ils sont enregistrés ici à leur réception.","Ibi byemezo bitangwa na IATA cyangwa ICAO, si ishuri. Byandikwa hano iyo ishuri ribyakiriye.","Vyeti hivi hutolewa na IATA au ICAO, si shule. Hurekodiwa hapa shule inapovipokea."),("Issued by","Délivré par","Cyatanzwe na","Kimetolewa na"),("Issued","Délivré le","Cyatanzwe ku wa","Kimetolewa"),("Exam","Examen","Ikizamini","Mtihani"),("Revoke","Révoquer","Hagarika","Batilisha"),("Reissue","Réémettre","Ongera utange","Toa upya"),("replaces","remplace","gisimbura","kinachukua nafasi ya"),("None recorded yet.","Aucun enregistré.","Nta na kimwe kiranditswe.","Bado hakuna kilichorekodiwa."),
("Track each registration: the fee paid on to IATA or ICAO, the exam date, the result and the certificate received.","Suivez chaque inscription : les frais reversés à l'IATA ou à l'OACI, la date, le résultat et le certificat reçu.","Kurikirana buri kwiyandikisha: amafaranga yishyuwe IATA cyangwa ICAO, itariki, ibyavuyemo n'icyemezo cyakiriwe.","Fuatilia kila usajili: ada iliyolipwa kwa IATA au ICAO, tarehe, matokeo na cheti kilichopokelewa."),("No exam registrations yet. Students ask for one from their dashboard.","Aucune inscription. Les étudiants en font la demande depuis leur tableau de bord.","Nta kwiyandikisha kurabaho. Abanyeshuri babisaba ku kibaho cyabo.","Bado hakuna usajili. Wanafunzi huomba kupitia dashibodi yao."),("Fee","Frais","Amafaranga","Ada"),("Currency","Devise","Ifaranga","Sarafu"),("certificate number","numéro de certificat","nomero y'icyemezo","nambari ya cheti"),("Certificate received","Certificat reçu le","Icyemezo cyakiriwe ku wa","Cheti kimepokelewa"),
